# GROOVE into REC with no dance: choose a groove, press REC - the take starts at once (also when REC waits for the first
# note); the loop goes round and the clip holds the drummer's LAST pass (no doubles stacked pass on pass); the clip is
# silent while the drummer plays, and plays when the drummer stops
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
onnote 1
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect track 4
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
seqtype 2
wait 100
expect seq 7
# 1) a groove playing (stopped, its own clock), REC: the take starts now
tapkey w3
wait 500
expect grcur 4
tap REC
wait 100
expect recording 1
expect playing 1
# two passes of the one-bar loop: VERSE 1 has 2 kicks, 2 snares, 8 hats = 12 a bar
wait 7000
tap REC
wait 300
expect events >9
expect dupes 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
# 2) REC first (waits for the first note), then a groove key: the take starts with it
tap REC
wait 200
expect recording 0
tapkey w6
wait 100
expect recording 1
expect grcur 7
wait 7000
tap REC
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect dupes 0
expect events >9
# the drummer stopped: the clip plays what was recorded
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect grcur 0
expect tvoices5 >0
tap PLAY
wait 200
